# ---- Archive is a byte-level ledger of preserved originals; it is *not*
#      committed to VCS because every byte is recapturable from the repository
#      audit manifests (original_file_inventory.csv, reorganization_manifest.csv).
#      The archive/ folder itself is fully excluded.
archive/

